<Base title="Terms" page="static"><section class="shell prose"><h1>How rooms work</h1><p>A free room offers two hours of text after a recipient joins. A Full room costs $2 once and offers a creator-selected duration up to three days, files, and voice. The invited person does not pay. An unclaimed invitation expires after 24 hours.</p><p>Pay for 3 Full rooms within one rolling 120-hour period and we add 8 Full room credits to your account. Credits apply automatically to your next Full rooms, including the creator-selected duration and Full features. Only successful $2 Stripe payments count; free rooms and rooms created with credits do not count toward another reward. Credits do not expire.</p><p>The first person to claim a link becomes the recipient. Share it only with the person you intend. A recipient can Quit without deleting the creator's existing view; the creator can Quit to end the room for both. Payment is for one room, not a subscription.</p></section></Base>
